---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Legal & Privacy" seo={{ page_description: "Terms of Service and Privacy Policy for uVideoPlayer." }}>
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-8 prose">
    <h1>Legal & Privacy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: November 2023</p>

    <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>
    <p>We respect your privacy. uVideoPlayer collects only the minimum amount of data necessary to provide our video hosting and playback services.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Video Analytics:</strong> We collect anonymous playback events (play, pause, completion) to provide you with bandwidth usage reports. We do not track individual viewer identities.</li>
      <li><strong>Cookies:</strong> Our embedded player does not set third-party tracking cookies.</li>
      <li><strong>Data Storage:</strong> Your raw video files are stored securely on AWS infrastructure and are never used to train machine learning models.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Terms of Service</h2>
    <p>By using uVideoPlayer, you agree to the following terms:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Content Ownership:</strong> You retain full rights and ownership of any video content you upload. We claim no rights to your intellectual property.</li>
      <li><strong>Acceptable Use:</strong> You may not use our service to host illegal content, malware, or content that infringes on copyright. We reserve the right to suspend accounts violating these terms.</li>
      <li><strong>Billing:</strong> Bandwidth is billed in arrears at the end of each month based on actual usage. The base subscription fee is billed in advance.</li>
      <li><strong>Service Level Agreement:</strong> We aim for 99.9% uptime for video delivery via our CDN partners.</li>
    </ul>

    <p>For detailed legal inquiries, please contact our support team.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
